{"text": "Later he met the Kolokolo Bird. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sitting in a thorn bush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody will answer me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But I still want to know. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Kolokolo Bird said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Go to the great grey green. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Greasy Limpopo River. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fever trees grow all along its banks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Go and find out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The very next morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He packed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A hundred pounds of bananas. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also took. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A hundred pounds of sugar cane. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And seventeen melons. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Goodbye he said to his family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am going to the Limpopo River. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He traveled for many days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Eating melons all the time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last he reached the great river. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There he met. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Bi Coloured Python Rock Snake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Curled around a rock. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Excuse me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Have you seen a Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Around here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked politely.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "h", "e", " ", "m", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "K", "o", "l", "o", "k", "o", "l", "o", " ", "B", "i", "r", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "t", "h", "o", "r", "n", " ", "b", "u", "s", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", " ", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "